OL,3,GNEWSA'Lost Italian masterpiece'
OL,4,Adiscovered at salvage yard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "lost masterpiece" created by an
OL,7,FItalian sculptor responsible for Rome's
OL,8,FTrevi fountain has been discovered in a
OL,9,Freclamation yard selling for just #300.
OL,11,FThe 68cm (27in) tall maquette of Pope
OL,12,FClement XII by Pietro Bracci was
OL,13,Fspotted by a collector at a salvage
OL,14,Fyard in Wiltshire.
OL,16,FStained, marked and covered in lichen,
OL,17,Fthe "lost masterpiece" is thought to
OL,18,Fhave been languishing in a garden in
OL,19,FAndover, Hampshire, for decades,
OL,20,Fauctioneer Mark Yuan-Richards said.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
