OL,3,GNEWSA'Lost Italian masterpiece'
OL,4,Adiscovered at salvage yard
OL,5,
OL,6,FDue to go under the hammer next week,
OL,7,FYuan-Richards, from auctioneers Woolley
OL,8,Fand Wallis, said: "Things like this
OL,9,Fnever come up on the open market. The
OL,10,Flast time one did, it made #170,000 but
OL,11,Fwho knows what this will make."
